    "gothere.select_afa.waiting_message" => ":date – :hour<hr> <p>Hello <b>:name</b>,</p> <p>Thank you for choosing the agency &ldquo;:afa&rdquo;.</p>
    <p>When you make your trip to Australia this French-speaking Australian Agency will pilot you on site and show you the property that interests you or others that are published on the IEA portal.
    The AFA will even be able to make you visit possibly projects or goods which would not yet appear on the portal.</p><p>We will get back to you as soon as we have received confirmation from the AFA.
    You will then receive a message via the portal&rsquo;s messaging system which will provide you with instructions and a link to download the official Australian standard form granting a search warrant to the AFA.
    After you have completed, dated, signed and scanned this official form, you will need to resend it by following the instructions given to you in the message. </p> <p> In the meantime,</p><p>Best regards </p> <p> Investing in Australia</p>",
    "gothere.select_afa.ca.message_to_afa" => "<p><small>:date – :hour</small></p><p class=&quot;p-10px-tb&quot;>Hi,</p><p class=&quot;p-10px-b&quot;>IEA portal Member <b>:name</b> (:immat) has decided to launch a purchase application for a property and has chosen your agency as the Francophone Australian Agency in charge of the transaction.</p><p class=&quot;p-10px-b&quot;>The principle of our collaboration is that the IEA system, after having identified, negotiated Australian programs and properties likely to be sold to non-resident foreigners, having published them on investirenaustralie.com internet portal, having developed a strategy of referencing (SEO) suitable for reaching the target international French-speaking markets, and having convinced investment candidates to take action, introduces you to international Francophone clients who wish to acquire property in Australia.Their file is then transferred to you and you take over to lead the transaction technically, materially, legally and financially to completion. You are the agency responsible for the operation and as such you receive the sales commission, as well as any bonuses, paid by the seller.</p><p class=&quot;p-10px-b&quot;>As a compensation for the clientele contribution operated by the IEA system, after having yourself been paid by the seller, you pay the company managing IEA portal a &ldquo;Clientele Presentation Commission&rdquo; - CPC equal to 50% of the amounts of commissions and bonuses you have received. The payment of this CPC is made through procedures monitored by IEA portal. These amounts are only due if the purchase transaction is successful and you have received your commissions.</p><p class=&quot;p-10px-b&quot;>When a purchase operation is launched it is necessary, for securing the remuneration of IEA system clientele contribution, to formalize between us a Conjunction Agreement which will establish the bases of the agreement between your agency on the one hand and on the other hand the IEA system and its own Australian real estate agency :agence.</p><p class=&quot;p-10px-b&quot;>This Conjunction Agreement is between your agency and IEA system Australian own agency, :agence. The Conjunction Agreement exists only as an insurance for securing the remuneration of the system and to guard against the cases of non-payment of this remuneration. It acts as a legal security. The principle of the system being that the CPC is paid by the AFA to the bank account of IEA portal managing company, the present Conjunction Agreement signed with :agence agency should not usually receive application unless the CPC is not paid to IEA system.</p><p>Since IEA portal Member :name has started a purchase process through the portal, it is now time to secure our deal. The draft Conjunction Agreement, together with its Schedule, already partially completed, can be downloaded from the link below :</p><p><a href=:download_ca target=_blank class=&quot;m-10px-tb m-btn m-btn-theme2nd text-center&quot;>CONJUNCTION AGREEMENT</a></p><p>After downloading it, we ask you to complete it, date it, sign it and scan it.</p><p>When this has been done, please send it back to us by clicking on the button below. The purchasing process will be interrupted until receipt of this document by IEA portal.</p><p><a href=:upload_ca target=_blank class=&quot;m-10px-tb m-btn m-btn-theme2nd text-center&quot;>SEND THE FINALIZED CONJUNCTION AGREEMENT</a></p><p>Awaiting the return of the above document.</p><p class=&quot;p-10px-tb&quot;>With our best regards</p><p>Investir en Australie</p>",
