    "gothere.select_afa.mr.message_to_member" => "<p><small>:date – :hour</small></p><p class=&quot;p-10px-tb&quot;>Hi <b>:name</b></p><p class=&quot;p-10px-b&quot;>The regulations in force in the State :etat requires the signature of a standard official form for the attribution of a search mandate to a real estate agency :</p><p class=&quot;p-10px-b&quot;><a href=:download_mr target=_blank class=&quot;m-10px-tb m-btn m-btn-theme2nd text-center&quot;>Real estate agency mandate</a></p><p class=&quot;p-10px-b&quot;>Please click on the link above which will allow you to obtain this official form which you will want to print, complete, initial each page, date, sign and scan.</p><p class=&quot;p-10px-b&quot;>You will then use the link below to return the scanned final form.</p><p class=&quot;p-10px-b&quot;><a href=:upload_mr target=_blank class=&quot;m-10px-tb m-btn m-btn-theme2nd text-center&quot;>RETURN THE FINALIZED MANDATE FORM</a></p><p class=&quot;p-10px-b&quot;>After this step the procedure on the portal will be put on hold for your trip to Australia to be completed and until you have made an informed decision regarding your investment.</p><p class=&quot;p-10px-tb&quot;>When you have decided on the date and duration of your trip to Australia, we thank you for informing the Agence Francophone Australienne. :afa that you have selected so that it can establish a visiting schedule for you.</p><p class=&quot;p-10px-tb&quot;>Very cordial greetings</p><p>Investir en Australie</p><p class=&quot;p-10px-tb text-right&quot;>:abort</p>",
    "btn.abort" => "<a class=&quot;m-btn m-btn-sm m-btn-theme&quot; href=:link>Abort</a>",
    "gothere.mr.message_to_afa" => "<p><small>:date – :hour</small></p><p class=&quot;p-10px-tb&quot;>Hi,</p><p class=&quot;p-10px-b&quot;>The IEA system&lsquo;s Member <b>:name</b> registered a <b>:immat</b> expressed the wish to come to :city to examine on site the programs and properties presented on Investir en Australie portal. Beforehand, the portal asked them to select an Australian Francophone Agency from :city who would show them round when they would make the planned trip.</p><p class=&quot;p-10px-b&quot;>The Member has chosen your agency <b>:afa</b>, which we congratulate you on.</p><p class=&quot;p-10px-b&quot;>The Member has committed to respect the rules and procedures of &ldquo;Investir en Australie&rdquo; portal and to irrevocably and exclusively grant your agency <b>:afa</b> mandate to search for properties and to carry out to its end the process of any possible resulting acquisition transaction.</p><p class=&quot;p-10px-b&quot;>The portal therefore made them sign the attached official form granting <i>:afa</i> a search warrant for property likely to interest them.</p><p class=&quot;p-10px-b&quot;>It will be your responsibility as the real estate agency responsible for the transaction to verify that any property the Member wishes to acquire can legally be sold to a non-resident foreigner, in accordance with the laws relating to the control of foreign direct investment in Australia and with the rules applied by the Foreign Investment Review Board (FIRB).</p><p class=&quot;p-10px-tb&quot;>This step marks the start of a process that could lead to a positive transaction, certifies that the Member is a client presented by IEA system and that the final transaction that could result would give IEA the right to the remuneration provided for in our agreements. This remuneration has been previously secured by the signing of the Conjunction Agreement.</p><p class=&quot;p-10px-b&quot;>The Member also became aware that, if they wished to complete the purchase of a property after having contacted your agency and you had accompanied them in their on-site visits, they should imperatively and formally return to IEA portal and click on &ldquo;<i>Je voudrais acheter ce bien</i>&rdquo; (&ldquo;I would like to buy this property&rdquo;) button to start the purchase process. We would like you to remind them to do so.</p><p class=&quot;p-10px-b&quot;>It is likely that the client will soon let you know when they plan to come to Australia. It will be a significant investment gesture. We thus ask you to give them the best welcome and to offer them your ultimate service, so as to create the top conditions for the outcome of a positive transaction.</p><p class=&quot;p-10px-b&quot;>The customer has formed a first idea of the property they wish to buy, but their choice may still change, in particular depending on the properties you will show them. We ask that you carefully listen to what they are looking for and make suggestions accordingly. It is quite possible that once there, their first choice will evolve towards another product, either published on the portal, or even towards a product which would not be published on the portal and which you would have presented to them on your own initiative. However, you will not be allowed to make the transaction if a property has been published on the portal by another agency, who then has an exclusivity. This would be the case if the program/product mentions that it is &ldquo;Exclusive Agency&ldquo;.</p><p class=&quot;p-10px-b&quot;>Whatever their final choice, this client is a Member of the IEA portal. It is therefore a client with a strong investment intention in mind that IEA is addressing to you. As such, the possible ensuing transaction would fall within the scope of the contract you have entered into with the IEA system. Consequently, in the case of an effective decision to buy, the remuneration of the IEA system would be due in full.</p><p class=&quot;p-10px-tb&quot;>With our best regards</p><p>Investir en Australie</p><p class=&quot;p-10px-b&quot;>Attached : <a href=:mandatesearch target=_blank class=&quot;m-10px-tb theme2nd-bg white-color p-5px-lr text-center&quot;> mandate to search for properties</a></p>",
    
    "tobuy.complete_registration.header" => ":date – :hour<hr> <p>Hello <b>:name</b>,</p> <p>We congratulate you and thank you for your decision to initiate an acquisition procedure on the &ldquo;Invest in Australia&rdquo; portal.<br/>
    When you trusted us to register as a Member on the portal, we asked you for a very limited amount of information about you. Now that you have decided to engage in an investment transaction, for the rest of the procedure, it is essential for the portal to have all the information useful for the conduct and completion of the transaction.<br/>
    We therefore ask you to follow the link below to complete your information. In the absence of this information, the file will not be able to progress.</p>",
